  "bodyHash": "098eb9d7bfe76541",
  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Trees</a>&nbsp;| <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></span></h2>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/910/506/quark.png\" alt=\"標頭\" width=\"1176\" height=\"480\"></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/A4FCBS3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Prkr13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>概述</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">本模組使 Quark 與 Dynamic Trees 相容，新增由該模組所添加樹木的動態生長版本，並在世界生成時完全取代它們。<br>利用樹木包（Tree Packs），可自訂與微調這些樹木、其行為及生成方式。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>功能特色</strong></strong></h2>\n<h4><strong>內建樹木</strong></h4>\n<h5>(1.20.1)</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">熾焰喇叭樹</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">霜寒喇叭樹</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">寧靜喇叭樹</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">明媚喇叭樹</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">溫暖喇叭樹</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">灰燼樹</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">發光蘑菇（安裝 Dynamic Trees+ 時可用）&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h5>(1.16.5 / 1.18.2)</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">熾焰繁花樹</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">霜寒繁花樹</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">寧靜繁花樹</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">明媚繁花樹</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">甜美繁花樹</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">溫暖繁花樹</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h5>(1.12.2)</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">繁花樹</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">沼澤橡樹</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><strong>Quark 的紫荊樹&nbsp;</strong></h4>\n<h5>(1.18.2)</h5>\n<p>透過此擴充模組，紫荊樹將擁有 Quark 的紫荊原木，並且會掉落更多原木以提升其實用性。</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/910/501/image.png\" alt=\"紫荊樹\" width=\"1206\" height=\"942\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>世界生成&nbsp;</strong></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">動態 Quark 樹木會生成於世界中。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">生成的紫荊樹也會帶有 Quark 的紫荊木材。<br></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">在 1.12.2 版本中，由於 Quark 的設定限制，本擴充模組無法自行停用非動態樹木的生成。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\">只需在 Quark 設定中停用繁花樹與沼澤樹即可輕易解決此問題。&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>其他擴充模組</strong></strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">其他模組的 Dynamic Trees 擴充模組可於<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\"> Dynamic Trees CurseForge 頁面</a>中取得。<br></span></p>\n<h4><strong>建議與請求</strong></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">如需請求新增相容新模組，請在此提出！！&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions</a><br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>需求</strong></strong></h2>\n<p>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Trees<br></a>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"><strong>授權與模組包</strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>您可以將其用於任何您想要的模組包中！無需事先詢問。<br>本模組採用 <strong>MIT</strong> 授權，原始碼已公開於 GitHub。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
